    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4754" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφα</span></b> , τό,
			indecl. (pl. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1087a8
				</span></i>
			), v. A a init.; cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				31.18
			</span></i>, Calliasap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				10.453d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				431e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσταται δ᾽ οὐδ᾽ ἄλφα συλλαβὴν
					γνῶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					3.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> T<i>-square,</i>
