		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἄλφα καὶ τὸ ὦ</span> the
			<i>first</i> and last, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apoc.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, al.</div>
